        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we offer data analytics and consulting services in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 39474,
        "end_character": 39547
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we provide clients with targeted, blended solutions based on a combination of software and software-enabled services.",
        "start_character": 2373,
        "end_character": 2504
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had more than 25,000 development, service and support professionals with significant expertise across the industries we serve and deep working knowledge of our clients’ businesses.",
        "start_character": 15654,
        "end_character": 15862
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on our experience, we believe numerous solution providers address highly particularized financial services needs or provide specialized services that would meet our disciplined acquisition criteria.",
        "start_character": 29571,
        "end_character": 29775
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By leveraging our domain expertise and knowledge, we have developed, and continue to improve, our mission-critical software products and services to enable our clients to overcome the complexities inherent in their businesses.",
        "start_character": 19647,
        "end_character": 19873
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By providing mission-critical, reliable software products and services for more than 35 years, we have developed a large and growing installed base within the financial services industry.",
        "start_character": 16582,
        "end_character": 16769
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Focusing on the needs of small- to medium-sized funds that require a broad set of customizable services, we provide compliance, creative services, medallion distribution, fund administration, fund accounting, legal, tax administration, transfer agency and asset management services.",
        "start_character": 38663,
        "end_character": 38945
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we utilize our software to deliver comprehensive fund administration services to alternative and traditional asset managers, including fund manager services, transfer agency services, funds-of-funds services, tax processing and accounting.",
        "start_character": 1927,
        "end_character": 2179
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe our acquisitions have been an extension of our research and development effort and have enabled us to add to our product and service offerings without incurring the uncertainties sometimes associated with software development projects.",
        "start_character": 27919,
        "end_character": 28178
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we intend to continue to develop our products cost-effectively by leveraging common components across product families.",
        "start_character": 21955,
        "end_character": 22087
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The market for the software and services we provide is competitive, rapidly evolving and highly sensitive to new product introductions and marketing efforts by industry participants, although high conversion costs can create barriers to adoption of new products or technologies.",
        "start_character": 63640,
        "end_character": 63918
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076745",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076745-c3055d9fa42fe622",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076745",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also face competition from information systems developed and serviced internally by the IT departments of large financial services and healthcare firms.",
        "start_character": 64080,
        "end_character": 64235
      }
    ]
